    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13815" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-στᾰτέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stand aloof from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					826
				</span></i>
			(lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				161
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				301
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔκουν πάρος γε σῆς ἀπεστάτουν φρενός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					993
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μορφῆς δὲ τῆς σῆς οὐκ ἀπεστάτει</span>
			<i>was</i> not <i>far from . .,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>OT</u>
				743
			</span></i>; <i>fall off from, fail</i> one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοὐκ ἀποστατῶ φίλων</span>”
