					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					312
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουλευτέον ὅπως μηδεὶς τῶν νῦν
					παρόντων ἀποστατήσει ἡμῶν συμμάχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					4.5.24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τῶν ὄντων</span>”
				<i>to be absent from,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prm.</u>
					144b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tht.</u>
				205a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the soul,
